&lt;li&gt;Partner with Lifecycle teams to deliver cohesive member journeys from acquisition through onboarding and early retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate results, insights, and recommendations to stakeholders, helping teams make informed decisions and prioritize growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
